# Power cut: switch to battery, alert after 2 min debounce, low battery, power back
present: seri-tool 0\.\d+\.\d+ \(SIM x60\) booting
in-order: SMS to \+919876543210: Shed-1: OK\s*$
in-order: PRINTER\| .* POWER CUT
in-order: SMS to \+919876543210: Shed-1: Power cut, on battery \d+% 
in-order: PRINTER\| .* BATTERY LOW 3\.6\dV
in-order: SMS to \+919876543210: Shed-1: Battery low \d+% 
in-order: PRINTER\| .* POWER BACK
in-order: SMS to \+919876543210: Shed-1: Power back
count == 1: SMS to .*Power cut
